# Normalise line endings for the whole repo.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites the
# template to CRLF, `npm run build` then emits CRLF, and the CI check that
# the committed output is up to date fails on every push — the bytes differ
# even though the content is identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
